"shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"fX57gus0k0WY92W8r-Mlwg","review_id":"WkyUygu8-6LeJwLPcubufg","date":"2020-02-20T18:35:56","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9441159963607788,"text_excerpt":"Ok it's official. Bearcat is my favorite breakfast/brunch place in all of NOLA. This location in the CBD area is fairly new and a short walk from my place. My boyfriend and I came on a Saturday around noon and to our surprise there was no wait at all. I'm sure that will change soon once people discover this location. My boyfriend had the fried chicken sandwich and it was the bomb. The fried chicken was tender, crispy, cooked to perfection, and the size of that chicken was huge. Best fried chicken sandwich I've had thus far. I had the catdaddy and I probably would've licked the plate clean if I wasn't in a public setting. The vegan queso was so good. I can't believe it's not real cheese. E..."},{"business_id":"fX57gus0k0WY92W8r-Mlwg","review_id":"u3JJ-O1WZ1xHBA_UrIpzDQ","date":"2021-08-12T16:54:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9354795813560486,"text_excerpt":"Bearcat Have you ever wanted to go to a restaurant and known that no matter what they were going to have a wait, because the food was just that good? Well @bearcatnola seems to be that spot, especially on weekends. This restaurant has expanded to two locations, one uptown and one in the CBD area. I've been wanting to visit for quite some time, so it was a definite yes when my sister asked me if I wanted to go for brunch. We went on a Sunday, and the check-in counter was packed and very hectic. I believe there was only one host, so the process was slow. We sat outside and it was a pretty nice day. The benches were nice, and I loved the greenery. It was very spacious. Cody was our server an..."},{"business_id":"fX57gus0k0WY92W8r-Mlwg","review_id":"AFKYCbHdRwAEf0S6-iDZ_w","date":"2020-03-05T16:34:33","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9340968728065491,"text_excerpt":"So this is by far my newest favorite restaurant in the CBD. I've been three times in the past month and just can't seem to get enough of it. My favorite appetizer is the buffalo cauliflower. Flashed fried with a nice and tangy sauce to compliment it, you can't go wrong here. I think the salmon on the bad cat menu is probably my favorite entree I've tried so far but I still have so much to try. Everyone at the table had nothing but great things to say about the place. I'm grateful for this newest addition to the neighborhood! Way to go BearCat!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"fX57gus0k0WY92W8r-Mlwg","photo_id":"q5awcx4LUgHHvmMZh0ekoA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/q5awcx4LUgHHvmMZh0ekoA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8815834522247314},{"business_id":"fX57gus0k0WY92W8r-Mlwg","photo_id":"9z-Gs-aKFYI5lJkUMcozMQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/9z-Gs-aKFYI5lJkUMcozMQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8170781135559082},{"business_id":"fX57gus0k0WY92W8r-Mlwg","photo_id":"MbggvLHMbCO4W3rlIkctjQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/MbggvLHMbCO4W3rlIkctjQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8062431812286377},{"business_id":"fX57gus0k0WY92W8r-Mlwg","photo_id":"2aqVdRRuatP8MUldTJYm_w","label":"outside","image_